WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.588
How do we raise self-reliant&nbsp;kids

00:00:02.588 --> 00:00:04.060
who have initiative,

00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:05.390
are resilient,

00:00:05.390 --> 00:00:07.170
and can be problem solvers?

00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:11.576
I believe we do that by 
raising kids who can think

00:00:11.576 --> 00:00:13.797
and act entrepreneurially.

00:00:13.797 --> 00:00:17.372
Whether a child&nbsp;chooses to build a company

00:00:17.372 --> 00:00:19.386
or become an employee,

00:00:19.386 --> 00:00:23.742
it doesn't matter because 
every kid needs&nbsp;to learn

00:00:23.742 --> 00:00:26.607
how to think like an entrepreneur.

00:00:26.607 --> 00:00:32.005
And the sooner we do this as parents,
create&nbsp;an environment at home

00:00:32.005 --> 00:00:34.146
where they have the opportunity

00:00:34.146 --> 00:00:40.324
and multiple occasions to challenge&nbsp;their
 beliefs about what's possible within them,

00:00:40.324 --> 00:00:42.486
to step outside of their comfort&nbsp;zone,

00:00:42.486 --> 00:00:47.798
to take risks, to learn from failure,
to bounce back from rejection.

00:00:47.798 --> 00:00:52.476
Then the sooner will put them on 
the path of living out their potential

00:00:52.476 --> 00:00:55.847
to lead&nbsp;very fulfilling and successful lives.

